1 WAIT

   Waits for a time.

   Format

     WAIT delta-time

2 Parameter

 delta-time

   How long to wait: [dddd-]hh:mm:ss.cc.

2 Description

   Ctrl/Y or Ctrl/C ends the wait.  Other processes (see SPAWN) run
   while it waits.  In a subprocess SPAWN is waiting for, the keys go
   to the subprocess, so they end its WAIT (see KEYS).  WAIT leaves
   $STATUS alone.

2 Examples

   1.$ WAIT 00:00:05

     Waits five seconds.
